From: Yiyu Zhou <yiyu@yiyuzhou.io>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 02:39:15 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 44/47] darwin: drop nix-init, which dev.nix installs

The Darwin package list repeated nix-init from the shared dev.nix.
Without the repetition, the system-path and system-applications
environments of nix-darwin lose their second nix-init entry and nothing
else, so their derivations change but install the same packages.
---
 systems/darwin/default.nix | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/systems/darwin/default.nix b/systems/darwin/default.nix
index b30153a..cfc274e 100644
--- a/systems/darwin/default.nix
+++ b/systems/darwin/default.nix
@@ -33,7 +33,6 @@
       # NixOS
       nixos-anywhere
       #nixos-facter
-      nix-init
 
       # TeX
       tectonic
-- 
2.56.1

